    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happens when you fuse a harpoon gun to a tow truck? Twin-stick car harpooning action! Harpoon and reel cars in, then tow them into the recycling crusher before time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for 1-4 players locally or over Steam Remote Play, get the most points in a versus match to win - even if it means recycling your friends and harpooning through their ropes. Or fend off foes from your extra lives in &quot;Protect your Trucklings&quot; mode and be the last truck driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not feeling like beating up your buddies? Play together in co-op while towing off waves of potential parking perpetrators.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage features different environments and challenges to be aware of, from crumbling statues in Parkin\u2019 Panic, to volcanic eruptions and homing lasers on tropical Volcarnage Island.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Play in versus mode against other players for points or stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Feeling friendly? Take on waves of cars in co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 \u201dProtect your Trucklings\u201d mode in a last truck standing battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple match customization settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Supports Steam Remote Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Googly eyes</p>",
